            "target_entity_instance": "eastern Kenya",
            "target_entity_type": "Country_Subdivision",
            "paragraph": "The OND short rains are more consistent but show notable peaks in 1997, 2006, and 2023, reflecting the strong influence of positive IOD and El Ni\u00f1o events, which warm the western Indian Ocean and intensify moisture transport into eastern Kenya.",
